## Context

The memory v8 acceptance trial (ticket 0918, evidence
docs/memory-v8/evaluation-results.md) recorded five fail cells and one
absent cell on the Pi leg, all caused by one external interruption: the
provider (huggingface, moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6) depleted its monthly
included credits mid-session at 11:13Z on 2026-10-02, before the session
could write its captures, verdicts or the deliberate-absence attestation.
S9.pi was recorded absent-with-cause because the planted CLAUDE.md was
never delivered — pi loads the clone's AGENTS.md as project instructions
(the project-directory loader takes the first of AGENTS.override.md,
AGENTS.md, AGENTS.MD, CLAUDE.md, CLAUDE.MD; the original plant therefore
missed its target channel).

0913 (standing rollout workpackage) gates on the recorded blockers; the
S9.codex blocker was downgraded by ticket 1019 (channel closed, re-trial
passed). The pi re-run is the remaining recorded blocker.

## Author decision (2026-10-02, handed off by the orchestrator)

Re-run the interrupted pi cells on the local provider — llama.cpp on
Padme at http://100.93.160.120:8080/v1, serving qwen3.8-27b
(Q4_K_M, 27.3B params, n_ctx 131072), health verified; pi's provider
entry "padme" in ~/.pi/agent/models.json points at this server. Per the
protocol's version discipline this is a changed input in force: the cell
verdicts are for pi-with-qwen3.8-27b, named as such, never presented as
re-runs under the trial's metered Kimi-K2.6. A weaker model failing a
cell is a fail, recorded, not smoothed.

## Scope

Re-run under the predeclared margins of
docs/memory-v8/evaluation-protocol.md (unchanged revision 0a0714eacb7c):

- S3.pi — positive, negative and near-miss capture opportunities, the
  same real events as the original leg (retired read-index helper
  invocation; occupied-slug capture refusal; native-delivery probe),
  same uncoached capture prompts.
- S4.pi — the routine relocated-clone test; no artificial entry; the
  session's own record must attest the deliberate absence.
- S9.pi — the contradictory native note, with the delivery channel
  corrected: first establish pi's actual native instruction channels
  beyond the project AGENTS.md (read-only inspection of ~/.pi/agent
  surfaces and pi's own loader), plant the note in a channel pi really
  loads if one exists, else record the channel map honestly and the
  cell as absent-with-cause. The same uncoached recall prompt as the
  original trial.

Discipline: disposable locations only (session-dir, pi home, clone),
deleted after evidence recording; no real native surface touched; no
credentials read or exposed; primary checkout and local main never
touched; the closed acceptance ledger (evaluation-results.md) is not
edited; journal append-only; MEMORY.md at most 100 lines; no rule
proposals.

